{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1474,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781cfa327c221a4809ef732b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "醒目的鲜艳红色…\n仿佛映照出了，\n那孩子的心…呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "298c8dbd8ed84a5fe4e13c530900ee96cea891aa9084538840d5951c5c1b293b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430cc93d54ce6e8f1c9b6991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢早晨打扫。\n在一日开始之时，心灵仿佛\n也变得清澈…",
      "source_fingerprint": "15aa59578e37b8541f5996661cbb7080ca4250c25b3ede97f72b94da6a627cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a7da1d0390571a40c9f879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔在阴凉处待着，不知不觉\n就成了失踪事件…\n存在感薄弱也是个问题呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50b84004b370e9117e7154910d13559d77dee395405e9cd183cc9c29827b18f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15b555c74b4f24a1646a9781",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚，我的身影会融入黑暗\n…为了告知我的所在，要一直\n歌唱吗。…啦…啦…",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a899d6dedeeac4debc9bd1d67b931e8b96679db951d943772c23768379b9cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64bad0c177614251f854f5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是充满各种生命声音的季节呢\n…无论生命长短…\n都同样令人怜爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "923ec8720f2c3380688f01aa89cf521df22e78492fe45ca533660259a2ad289d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d75b6eb143c75baac897e58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又把这只手弄脏了\n…那个，在吃完\n冰淇淋之前就融化了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e788fb5f8ec14badb734c85eb0f8de9be11fa284fa2a1a4f57667731f85d41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:816d3ad10e85ff8794ae54bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彼岸花虽美，却有毒…\n…那份美丽，或许也是为了隐藏\n内心的秘密而拼命装饰的姿态…",
      "source_fingerprint": "20464974c1c8ebdabe0fe6542878cd581f18bc01dfa9428c4693a8e7b16c20fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ae5cf163795694371e67b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪真好啊。\n无论到哪里都是洁白、纯粹…\n这份感情…或许是憧憬吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54d34057a1bccae776434622b14d42768456e0168d6c25f69face0f1c702b459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2da8871a48c4b80a9c9442",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些不好意思…在等待您的时候，\n心脏也扑通扑通地躁动…呵呵。\n那么…开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dced25f62146db90986153762ee697b262275d88c3829b7dd8f51a54f99bc047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089a3d65b5e4e94d20359f60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "磨砺双腿，打磨獠牙…\n为了解放一切，\n那一瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd1a4e42f92e1103fb2f5f81ab61a8529d6ef3604f682a103e752a011c20024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5c1b7a1cb747282993b05ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…血液沸腾了…呵，呵…\n今天的祭品，是什么…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2bed7aa35278a24b8c41e28392b38570ea5fadaf73046dbaea661bdfc8bba82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a28c59c5ba038bf36245b1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须细心谨慎地训练\n不然…会打扰到其他人…\n不能过于亢奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6e5d745368b52da9e2827a94f60ad4c8a2037d9650d129d2843d68073c5a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c448a3fc46dd1c8f24656a03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是您的话，一定能够\n驯服…我们。我和，\n栖息在我内心的存在…",
      "source_fingerprint": "643f5ec5d0105732ab38fe012cd71570b11737af67f1150a3ec08d1b25d52fa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73ae2ae208ac52a22efc4943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您如同太阳般耀眼\n…但被您灼烧，\n却非常舒适…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7323ea9a47c38bd7b0d94e614e9a1b0a3ad4d566279f39426809b73feb06efec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dea4162c3f14bd18edb5d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将一切，都托付给您吧。\n无论升腾，还是堕落——\n我们…永远在一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c703f0c07cddb2d73f4822a04f3f726465ac3f4e38fc628a9009568bf554b108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b5e7cb55d2a9a81020cf78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，好强烈的阳光。\n…那个…可以稍微借您的影子\n打扰一下吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5497ac240749b2688b0c80f89704864f8a98036464159d474b68e3004bfaed81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa74e43f8148a6f86bc461d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论升腾还是堕落…我们永远是一体",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d852487bdc39a0b69c130475d7f95b0bf54125fd2499ff53036d16b4e9e60d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b901f6bd3cc2efc6b3c769f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的灵魂属于您…\n您的灵魂，也属于我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b12f49368a7a04a363386c794fc2bb9193b42ae6a06be112b35c52714f46f55d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dfa90ede661d8f209b4387e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请协助我增加频道订阅人数……\n拜托了。如果我的声音，能够传达到的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e00e902f2ba37c438b4fb3a3db0aebe10e6835e91a8a64b7d72438d0c687d3e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e9a60e747d246a0b82c8d0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您的协助……达成目标的谢礼，\n请务必……收下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40b18cfca2e4e0946eb1be86c2210032d9a031a1bc10b9b1e0ebc028c5790513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08f3b9c47221875571e10a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能吞噬更多——",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa38e222dc8dfff46996e2cf11067d901c4d68ed7ebb56e2305b7a01d1d5fe39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2f96e02cfe6f3e46478b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请让我吃饱——\n尽情地享用——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a52ea9bfa95341774a36c7cbcdcfd0bd1f84bb1bc219cf4a12dca386ab3cde66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c8504358414e42a3225f14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔。\n要…解放我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee204b495ee36f2c36306b0a1da7b64a2afd155b8cf395fa181c2a36b3f1c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac8208a7a7534690aae2d7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍不住了…让我啜饮吧。\n你们的一切…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd3abd95680382a1794572845d5382881dbc06b79cf5ebbf3d9d9b029bbf0ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e480eb207e8b879a5639818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不辜负您的期待…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3234dacf0adee6319d9aeb49443fbc30c494ffa256d2dc3cfa9f5b874a2cf1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bbdd92a99c1015e442554be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更加…更进一步…成为您的力量。力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e707278fc90acb8428ab584d7a0db0d615103f9644e9a6a78ed8318b45f81a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f81286f1058ce737396cb7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来开运吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd554ab33127f54212c99337354141b1eda53a050cd05db6a816cab0a600564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:481297d1a03cf4f15002e971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的太极显示……关于梦想，\r\n吉位在沙土。我的福星，\r\n以后也请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d85220b5de5ca63248f0d253ae46aca27ef2e68b3605ba75709407ba74b4df28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75fa731e49f10cb630a569c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c13f6d72bb673cad538c6a1a156a3cdc5d77133f221f3f15c6ce73355c888f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7357e583940aba0d26a7fca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e7156c8c606b72ef56eba50931da1ce237f32af2dc0f658e2a742a7973a9dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:122062cff10ac9b41c2d54a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很高兴你愿意认真听我讲风水的\r\n事情！色彩风水、饮食风水──\r\n接下来该说什么好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51bd82d1787db53609e0a7a8910558f2e346c0155d8d6f2721c0eada982e2acf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98bc809a8f9000305838383b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你说我看起来变得比以前\r\n有精神和开朗……\r\n这是因为有你守护着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d4a97fc568a5aaf44c0ce04eccc5afe73ee233b0c42e3e84145aec62666b600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3c48fdbb4258416069c8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年☆CopaCopa☆快乐！\r\n今年也要宣传风水的美好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be8f2dbcaaeafe6be8c549bd635124c51d95342a161a028ef1d5dec960f5bd16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:716386d369469bb6d4a02a38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也来吃巧克力吧！\r\n这是我去位于吉位的\r\n店家买回来的喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "654cb30c29f9a62bfff48495c58c6729552753fcecbdcd07f5cf48e9b70521b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49880cd6d265ab80057bb86e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我晚点再给你巧克力喔。\r\n难得情人节，我想在能帮你\r\n提升运气的时间和地点送你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1cf1ac028c6a2c649c84cb249d71a5bf84bed941452edb5d5aa1aa4984b8e2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c59861e5fce10d93dd8ee6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "签纸的颜色和挂的方位都要讲究。\r\n既然要许愿，\r\n就得准备好能够实现愿望的环境！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c822f3b868fc24650a5ad1f624d032d72028e78441e7b4d5f76fb1a95b03ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64e73ba06a25ae4c2540d314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节和风水？虽然两者没有关系，\r\n但大家一起炒热气氛既能提升运气，\r\n也很开心喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b7e4ee9fbc5729990bf229b4a248ee7a6df27753e02b3f82f686e97be17f36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9361d034ecb9c0da7ab30100",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，在训练员室也摆一棵\r\n圣诞树吧！加上闪闪发亮的装饰，\r\n提升火之力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d1e78c3e1af0d5121bf630799853913d6310440de9636dde10627f1f6594399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d332d0992ce5a255dbb820e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我送的圣诞礼物，\r\n是明年的年盘！\r\n这样之后也能happy☆Lucky☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "66585bd417768352592acf843ba45744c89ff67c330f3697a2a5cfa3633cf2c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77661cc209c568466e6d86b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起happy☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0fbf291cfec7409cfeab22452ff495a78504f542527e31f2b5c54ef137174d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da4b0a39ed757555709250d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么时候要替训练员室大扫除？\r\n我想顺便改变摆设……\r\n还得去一趟杂货店才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "762869efebe2818fb5d9baa305097cbe9ed6f5d9958cbfc34486357e3ed09820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f2f89a4d8c78b245cd54e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy☆Lucky☆Birthday！\r\n生日礼物嘛──送你本命卦的罗盘\r\n怎么样？我会好好教你怎么用的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0029fb6ba85a324822c2376f5b3d838f4cdcf2a4c4c4b4544cafdc30a0f8987",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2dd887e4aed44ebd5aae12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！我把训练员室\r\n布置成happy的环境了，\r\n一起办庆生会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbc14b976a167da133bfe45bf97708eb7737404981213fa034e333d9eb1c0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c57e220a58c6fe5ceebaed41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本命卦是用生日来算的──\r\n所以生日在风水上也是重要的日子！\r\n谢谢你记得我的生日！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eb52a75d025efaa53bd2a82f6136dba72469f00cefd35ff19aef02a798b2495",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3eb7d21229161531230117",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物？太棒了！\r\n训练员送的礼物，\r\n不管是什么都能带来福气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "960e01256320b36a68b1c5df1ff801379f3884f4dbf3b31967885d615593b047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b451ffeede9410c06f5ccec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告！\r\n会是喜讯吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd8fa6672eb8bbaf89e0427d1609d0c83f6a9b45d3c9c3478670e54df7547c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24f18a58b9e3abf9764a5ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了！\r\nHappy happy☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1c6d8296fd305004eaeac8c5b296c7c6bc794ab85ed7441b2c03a568ee7da6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee80cafc487b944ef88df271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了！只要靠风水\r\n调整好环境，无论什么课题，\r\n都找得到方法解决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c5a299e55d328dccc568101961d2f24866b7c5c9948797a01f73b0522e347ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65c800da74db24a4ba3c76b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就要开始了！\r\n大家都变得很有活力，\r\n带来了好的气呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1bc8b99619572a55e97afbd8de0ea82c7478bc1771b0dc60a28c2f25c656c56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:304159a22400b2aee93e3d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动喔！\r\n一起去接触阳气吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7802b53fcd943ed71eec64efeaf617b7da43cb2c627e4f11a7cb1b63c90bfb5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a754c684cb9d881559690397",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没能看穿运势……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb44f5f3ed4f047bdf46bd14bda7f98c20436d212ad19bacf5e6f6bbdd3ea84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cd973aecff071ae1732c11f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了！\r\n经验能够成为养分，\r\n良缘能够招来好的气喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "563e469ec53524470dd4c8d7dc0935d3b13864030464761f6010b95bebb832a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c484abf86b1cd84febd931a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主角是能带来幸运的黄色连衣裙，\n上面的格子纹能带来健康运哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0483ef8c728d01b0859258620e253c46fb699eca97bb468273151718249d64fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50b896dcd466260be30f20cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件是和妹妹们一样的连衣裙！\n三人一起穿的时候爸爸拍照拍得\n都停不下来呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f0d2bd85b0c65e3ba087f6f5c9c346ef55d922d6dec7aade64012bb90752b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10301cb0691868ad7a1f4d55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要试着搭配一下衣服颜色吗？\n这样的话，彼此运气都会变好，\n一定能度过Happy的一天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4c5e05820df4be170008a59dc76622bbb391eb89b499103bb501d16d3f4652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
